  "description": "Years after losing his parents, Ju-Hwan Kim has resigned himself to a life of loneliness. But on Christmas Eve, a mysterious man dressed as Santa grants his wish for a family of his own and transports him to another world. There, he finds an unlikely home with Lizzie, a traumatized widow, and her young stepdaughter. Determined to protect the family fate has given him, Ju-Hwan must learn how to hunt, master his newfound magical powers, and survive in a world where kindness is a rare luxury.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
